"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!N87Oinlk6KzmPzcY.Nsq37LYvx8Gc8M1O"},{"_id":"8o2bInfOF1127QOn","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Adamantine Weight","sort":1100000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon shapes rocks even after it throws them, capturing its prey. The creature struck must succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:44|options:inflicts:immobilized] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}. Creatures remain immobilized until they Escape and immediately fall if they're flying. The weight can be destroyed as an object with 40 Hit Points and 20 Hardness.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["earth","metal","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!N87Oinlk6KzmPzcY.8o2bInfOF1127QOn"},{"_id":"S1Ztj3jcXHNboSRl","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Avalanche Breath","sort":1200000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon belches a mass of boulders that deals @Damage[17d8[bludgeoning]|options:area-damage] damage in a @Template[cone|distance:44] (@Check[reflex|dc:50|basic|options:area-effect] save).</p>\n<p>They can't use Avalanche Breath again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Avalanche Breath]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.ite